      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Kit Fan’s debut novel, Diamond Hill, paints life in the 1980s squatter village that once dotted the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diamond_Hill",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Kowloon entrance of Tate’s Cairn Tunnel lies in Diamond Hill, linking the hill to the rest of Kowloon.",
